            <div xml:id="m-e0360fa3-bcfe-4a66-932c-e9e6d6d817e9">
              <lg xml:id="m-d6a4d6ea-3af9-484c-b1d5-6b09c833e707">
                <l xml:id="m-70340d83-9ec9-46e1-aa3d-8c7e576c6a23" facs="#m-42412c91-5a50-4b4b-b2ac-07c7ed4a5393" label="ambiguous">Credidi. 1. D. D. Da f. g. g", a. a", aa</l><l xml:id="m-d182669f-3b1e-4233-a40d-cd63cdd08be0" facs="#m-e2626c69-bfda-4403-894a-9b91c69ea02b" label="ambiguous">1e1</l><l xml:id="m-e6f8fbf3-f579-4fe3-b810-2b0668349f0c" facs="#m-58697dc3-a7ed-422c-8704-7f5ba20f935e" label="lyrics-like">19. Qui tíment Dóminum speravérunt in Dómino:“ adjútor eórum et</l><l xml:id="m-b665c14c-8f8b-4f1d-acb3-946183336e97" facs="#m-a2535ac6-41ee-4577-8a0e-0d59ca2debc4" label="lyrics-like">protéctor eórum est.</l><l xml:id="m-23d5f295-5cd8-4fa8-b176-6b70f977a2ce" facs="#m-402316d4-f2ea-4873-86db-198d95a7cc1c" label="lyrics-like">20. Dóminus mémor fuit nóstri:*et benedixit nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-95dd45f1-1888-4451-97c5-125cbe927596" facs="#m-b25fc633-a915-48be-875e-5fd270324b47" label="lyrics-like">21. Benedixit dómui Israel: * benedixit dómu! Aaron.</l><l xml:id="m-97f9507d-78aa-4fa7-a1a7-6dc3f0ad9496" facs="#m-34f9b36b-cca0-4e49-b36a-8e57a17da714" label="lyrics-like">22. Benedixit ómnibus qui timent Dóminum, * pusillis cum majóribus.</l><l xml:id="m-830d2c92-15c5-48b9-9834-34de78b2d6f2" facs="#m-28cf50eb-3793-4e5b-a0a0-57457fbcb893" label="lyrics-like">23. Adjíciat Dóminus súper vos: * super vos, et super fílios véstros.</l><l xml:id="m-66d81a62-bf1d-40e8-90c2-d6bdda2c836d" facs="#m-ba2387c1-93dd-4781-8e18-0dfdc8ef9b95" label="lyrics-like">24. Benedicti vos a Dómino, * qui fécit caélum et térram.</l><l xml:id="m-321c941e-6687-4d83-8c58-e70a43556eef" facs="#m-8307fafe-6f3b-4345-964a-8df69fd8ffcc" label="lyrics-like">25. Caélum caéti Dómino: *térram autem dédit filiis hóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9663c097-bbd6-48d8-a2ce-30f71b3fca2f" facs="#m-9493a744-ea16-4dff-a5a7-7fc8da15be39" label="lyrics-like">26. Non mórtui laudábunt te Dómine: “neque ómnes qui descéndunt</l><l xml:id="m-b867630e-cd60-45ae-9f98-05d059dfc88e" facs="#m-5a4630b0-7e63-4f9e-a239-065b9de11292" label="lyrics-like">in inférnum.</l><l xml:id="m-e78b6048-a095-47f8-b2b1-e8f601f41260" facs="#m-d38dcc95-0d81-4afb-a71a-36d9ed4895f3" label="lyrics-like">27. Sed nos qui vívimus, benedicimus Dómino, * ex hoc nunc et usque</l><l xml:id="m-0280660c-d52d-4e39-83bb-27545db7dc2b" facs="#m-025bc442-315d-4c69-8165-4bebf62d427b" label="lyrics-like">in saéculum.</l><l xml:id="m-65d1e570-0879-44ce-ab97-1d52b024823d" facs="#m-43a7ff4a-33bd-47be-8f4d-2e7b6417d75f" label="lyrics-like">28. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-fdfb990c-fcf9-4c58-b9be-3089ae4c1e6e" facs="#m-7a469124-d381-42b8-8cb5-4799093d31b0" label="lyrics-like">29. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-972b5d7a-b779-4d91-84af-ff0b2061e6ca" facs="#m-cf7f811c-6f1d-46a8-bfe7-9826e1bb327c" label="ambiguous">rum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-16f8e148-d1a2-4e05-8582-02d68132d414" facs="#m-18d01dbb-bbf3-4caa-8b23-d586a31df6e4" label="ambiguous">Psalm 115. Credidi.</l><l xml:id="m-2d886a94-d3a9-4e33-a481-7295cb5caa5f" facs="#m-639ee12a-a5f6-497d-b817-7796e5cec0c6" label="ambiguous">Tone 1. D, D, Da, f, g, gr, a, a", a".</l><l xml:id="m-99139736-c1b8-4d47-abba-d1646248f7cf" facs="#m-dcc98efc-2d05-4007-98d3-3568eaaf2749" label="text-like">Endings of 1 accent with 2 prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-39e81cb1-5507-4d63-a9ee-c2d4d341a29b" facs="#m-d890a3e5-1c02-491a-a63a-fbafe9925203" label="text-like">Mediant of z accents.</l><l xml:id="m-06ac9127-80cf-4d71-887a-e1a11cbe3da6" facs="#m-81ab4be9-7e58-4525-8110-1e9d440746f1" label="text-like">tory syllables. (For the ending Di, an</l><l xml:id="m-5be106a7-c514-47f6-89b9-4e79fec3fa84" facs="#m-60d47604-7e3b-4ae2-a0c6-23f340da7790" label="text-like">extra note is added in anticipation &amp;</l><l xml:id="m-7c1b32e6-24a5-4200-8027-11ba38257d21" facs="#m-ce987500-dd99-42a5-b7ed-69540282eb61" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadences.)</l><l xml:id="m-46188bed-d1eb-4b1f-a144-477d9aa978d8" facs="#m-00c37d80-4a08-47f4-9fa8-2fdb7639011d" label="lyrics-like">1. Crédi-di propter quód loeútus sum:* égo autem humi-li-átus sum</l><l xml:id="m-627f92dd-4824-4eea-97d7-4c74774d2b24" facs="#m-9ddc7bfc-06a4-4025-9b04-07be2d7ded1e" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-71807b88-063a-4b4b-8bbc-243310875639" facs="#m-57dfedfc-9764-4b62-821d-e08ee0222a8b" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-42bcece4-f06b-44ad-848f-d6a7b2b55e06" facs="#m-44509abc-8be6-437b-bca8-c307265edc7e" label="ambiguous">— Da</l><l xml:id="m-c3a9b5ba-6040-4098-b03b-c4bbb81538f0" facs="#m-dff7e47e-198f-455a-8f04-16d260eadd6b" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-3d976ac4-357a-4b13-81b1-56abca3d38a1" facs="#m-f6993ee4-ab12-4c45-add2-9bfa90ffac48" label="ambiguous">8</l><l xml:id="m-c3a043ff-3917-4545-9989-bd2e1c10d27c" facs="#m-b4084db8-e908-4b54-a446-0d38e08dea15" label="text-like">ni- mis. or : ni- mis. or: nimis. or: ni- mis. or: ni- mis.</l><l xml:id="m-ee86a18a-67a9-43ea-99f8-4ab33ded1ee2" facs="#m-e3a51a63-2efa-4d1c-9f66-1dfe94103259" label="ambiguous">a¬</l><l xml:id="m-518c633f-4818-45ee-90b9-f8a4e35a1cb3" facs="#m-ac555049-cf68-4de5-9025-91558ff3834c" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-e6cf2d71-bb05-4fb4-9fe8-f4609b8f4be6" facs="#m-ebf6c509-a184-453d-9880-8ad59288a45d" label="ambiguous">a"</l><l xml:id="m-1cf883a8-0bf3-4de8-8e43-dd9f951da9c4" facs="#m-e0d77adf-e419-4e56-b148-2c0c44cfeb49" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-24af0d92-1135-4b70-a4b9-f28271f2b1ab" facs="#m-fe22ad4a-4efb-4f7e-a8c1-5def46dd80e4" label="lyrics-like">or: ni-mis. or :ni-mis. or : ni- mis. or: ni- mis. Flex: víncu-la</l><l xml:id="m-2ac3601d-0cd4-4e21-a5eb-159e9a0a7cac" facs="#m-b6f08179-9294-4a53-a83a-6a6208b92f15" label="lyrics-like">mé-a:t</l><l xml:id="m-dbde822f-c709-49c3-aaed-b147f059b033" facs="#m-54d668d4-fe92-492d-bf7a-9b0a5e7a748e" label="lyrics-like">2. Ego dixi in excéssu méo:“Omnis hómo méndax.</l><l xml:id="m-42f05802-180b-461b-b2ed-de5261a71670" facs="#m-df7b1c80-4a64-4e51-bcb5-7083dcd15465" label="lyrics-like">3. Quid retribuam Dómino, “ pro ómnibus quae retríbuit mihi?</l><l xml:id="m-1083eb6d-5fc5-4c85-badd-d1b66c807d2e" facs="#m-e733481f-faf3-4f61-9b87-c719e5a1d281" label="lyrics-like">4. Cálicem salutáris accipiam:“et nómen Dómini invocábo.</l><l xml:id="m-489d0c1e-1650-491c-8583-ce9e14ff3731" facs="#m-e3728fe1-b4a5-4420-a9fc-d039ab344401" label="lyrics-like">5. Vóta méa Dómino réddam coram ómni pópulo éjus:“pretiósa</l><l xml:id="m-3b548d38-4842-4e7d-af5b-9ff81fab65f3" facs="#m-42e2330f-4084-4a2b-baeb-9f3c392e2f36" label="lyrics-like">in conspéctu Dómini mors sanctórum éjus.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>